  "body": "Positioned in the heart of Browns Bay’s beachside township, this well-maintained upper-level unit presents a timely opportunity to buy a property in one of the Shore’s most consistently sought-after coastal centres. With the beach, village amenities, markets, public transport and everyday essentials all within easy walking distance, buyers will immediately recognise the strength of the location and the long-term value that comes with it. For investors, you won’t find a better return on investment on the Shore with positive cashflow from day one.\r\n\r\nThe home is in excellent condition, offering a tidy, smart, functional layout with a modern interior, including dishwasher and outdoor lockup shed for your bikes. The kitchen, bathroom, and living areas look fabulous, and the overall environment is safe, with a friendly village feel. Ongoing maintenance is simple and low cost. NO BODY CORP FEES HERE!\r\n\r\nThis address has long been favoured for its simplicity and ease of ownership. Purchasers can research the wider area with confidence, whether that’s Browns Bay’s retail and dining precinct, the coastal walkway network, transport links, or the broader development activity occurring across the East Coast Bays.\r\n\r\nIn a market where well kept, low maintenance property close to the beach are increasingly scarce, this one stands out as a smart, accessible choice and viewing is highly recommended.",
